(7737213, 1275514, 114285, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you got out of your comfort zone to shoot this. Only way to learn.<br/> <br/>I liked the concept here, just felt it was a tiny bit OOF and a little under exposed. The cake, I''m assuming in the background looked like a blob also, couldn''t distinguish exactly what it was. Did you add the grain for effect also?<br/> <br/>Composition was spot on though.</td>', 'I''m glad you got out of your comfort zone to shoot this. Only way to learn. I liked the concept here, just felt it was a tiny bit OOF and a little under exposed. The cake, I''m assuming in the background looked like a blob also, couldn''t distinguish exactly what it was. Did you add the grain for effect also? Composition was spot on though.', '2023-01-25 00:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
